00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:22.160
that would persist for the rest of their lives&nbsp;
washington who had no biological children probably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:27.040
viewed the young hamilton as someone he could&nbsp;
