00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:12.400
needed to be seized colonel hamilton was named&nbsp;
commander of the american effort to recapture&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:17.360
redoubt number 10 while the french seized number&nbsp;
