00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:31.760
cornwallis fate was sealed five days later eight&nbsp;
thousand soldiers marched out of yorktown having&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:36.000
surrendered to the americans and the french even&nbsp;
though new york would be occupied by the british&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:41.920
